  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-05T17:51:22.611Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "**If you enter play mode, the SDK control panel doesn't switch tabs properly.**\n\n*Here's two examples which often disrupt my workflow.*\n\n1. Enter the build or content manager tab (leave it open)\n2. Enter and exit play mode\nThe SDK switches back to the authentication tab instead of staying in the previously selected tab.\n\n1. Enter the settings tab\n2. Enter and exit play mode\nThe build and content manager tabs are greyed out. The settings tab remains selected. Opening the authentication tab fixes the issue.\n\n*SDK version 2021.09.03.09.25*\n*Unity 2019.4.29f1*",
